WEBVTT

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:40.730
Erulogos, wait.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.560
Why do you hesitate?

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:46.470
If we seal Darkstar onto this
world, all will be settled.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:52.470
But we didn't come to this
world to destroy it!

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:54.940
We didn't come here
to save it, either.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:55.640
What?!

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:58.580
For now, we'll concentrate
on obtaining Galvayra.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:03.310
No objections?

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.350
Let's go, Sirius!

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:19.130
You'd have us become destroyers
ourselves, Erulogos?

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:24.020
Forgive me. This is all
the water I have.

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:26.200
But I'm sure I'll
have more tomorrow...

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:29.260
...so you all try to bloom into
the prettiest flowers you can.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.150
What?

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.970
Here... This is where my
servant creatures vanished.

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:02.170
Do you sense anything?

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.430
No, I'm still not sure.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.170
I don't have
enough information.

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.240
Then we'll proceed
as we always do.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.520
Are you going to act
like Almayce as well?!

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:17.950
I said we don't have
enough information.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:20.950
Do what you want!
Just don't forget.

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:24.890
We have a limited
amount of time left.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:41.440
Who's that?

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:54.050
That man...
That man must be!

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:19.640
I've heard this place was
once a gold-mining boom town.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.610
This town?
You're kidding, right?

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:24.680
The town fell apart
once the gold ran out.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:27.520
In the end,
people are all the same...

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.290
Mr. Zelgadis,
you're so gloomy!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.930
Being gloomy leads to
unnecessary unhappiness.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.390
Well, EXCUSE ME
for being gloomy.

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:34.990
Anyway...

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:39.500
Look, Filia, are you sure the
final weapon is hidden here?

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:42.800
I'm getting the feeling
you're tricking us.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.840
Wh- What did you say?!

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:47.600
You still don't trust
my holy priestess powers...

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.110
...which let me
find all of you?!

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:54.570
The final Darkstar weapon is
definitely in this direction!

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.520
Filia, your underwear's showing.

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:58.650
Oh, that's cute!

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:01.210
I love your tail, Miss!

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:06.590
But this'll make it prettier.

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:08.500
See?

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:13.600
Th- Thank you very much.
What pretty flowers!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:15.470
Well, what have we here?

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:18.940
Are you still
doing that job, Anna?

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:23.610
We're finally
abandoning this town.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.810
You should come with us!

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.280
Who cares about
those stupid flowers?

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:31.290
Yeah, right! Growing flowers
doesn't put food in your belly!

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:35.760
I'll be fine. Anyway,
this one just bloomed.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.450
Take care of yourselves.

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:41.060
I don't want
the stupid thing!

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:46.100
Hey, you! That's going
a little too far!

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:50.210
Anna, you won't do
yourself any good...

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.210
...by hanging around with a
bunch of weirdo strangers.

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:53.900
The only people
who come here now...

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:57.440
...are losers who are
searching for gold.

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:01.050
Who are you calling a loser?!

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.140
BEHFIS BRI NG!!!

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:08.150
Looks like those guys
were the real losers here.

00:07:19.340 --> 00:07:21.700
Pretty lonely
town you have here.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.130
But my grandpa told
me before he died...

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:27.130
...that when they
still mined gold here...

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.470
...it was a nice town with
lots of people living here.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:34.180
But then. one day, all the
town's wells dried up.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:35.320
The wells?

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:36.940
No gold and no water.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:39.610
Which means no
future for the town.

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:41.450
Oh, but it's all right!

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.920
I just know a hero has
come to save the town!

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:46.160
A hero?

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:49.730
My mother told me about it
a lot before she died.

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:52.970
When the flowers in
the flower bed bloom fully...

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.600
...a hero will come to
save us from bad people.

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:59.040
That's why I know the
town will be all right!

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:04.170
Um...
Yes, of course, Miss Anna!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:07.110
I'm sure your late mother
is high up in heaven...

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:08.910
...praying for your happiness!

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:10.580
Right.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:15.320
Um, look... We still have to
find that final weapon, so...

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.030
That's!

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:27.600
What's up?
What's wrong, Lina?

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.030
Let's go.

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:29.970
Right!

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:35.510
The hero...

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:40.480
That guy... That guy...

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.150
No doubt about it!

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:43.810
Lina!

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:47.660
What's wrong? Why'd you
suddenly jump out like that?

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:50.090
That guy!
One of Almayce's pals!

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:52.290
He was there when
the gateway was opened!

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:01.930
He's gone!

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:02.970
Miss Lina!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:05.030
Lina! What's going on?

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:07.670
Did you see someone you know?

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:12.010
Yeah. Although he's not
what I'd call a close friend.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.560
Now go, my servants!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:53.380
Mr. Hero!
I want to welcome you.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:54.120
Here.

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:05.830
These are the prettiest flowers
from my secret garden.

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:12.870
What a big hand, but it's warm.

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:15.640
Like my late
father's hands were...

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:19.250
What?!

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:20.370
Erulogos's friend?

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:23.810
Yeah. I'm positive I saw him.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:26.320
He was with Erulogos
at the Darkstar gateway.

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:28.890
A God from the Overworld
has come to this town?!

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:32.050
Does that mean the
final weapon really is here?

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:34.390
Well, I won't go that far.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.800
But it's clear that
something's up around here.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:41.170
But when you add in that
strange legend for this town...

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.670
She said a hero will come to save
the town, and now it'll be all right!

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:48.000
Of course!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.710
You don't think that hero is!

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.540
Oh, I'm willing to bet on it.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:39.140
As I thought. Beneath here...

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:41.920
Mr. Hero!

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.020
So, here you are!

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.560
I thought you might be hungry.

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:52.000
I didn't have much time,
but I made a lot of things.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:56.360
It's not much, but... Here!
Please take it, Mr. Hero.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:05.940
I believed! I knew you'd
come to save our town.

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:07.740
Well? Didn't you?

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:22.030
Anna! Look out!

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.560
Anna!

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:40.580
Anna! Don't be fooled!

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:45.850
If you let him sucker you, he'll blast
this town to dust in an instant!

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:47.190
That's not true!

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:53.490
He's not an evil man!
Because... He's a hero!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.020
Like my mother said!

00:12:56.100 --> 00:13:00.590
He's the legendary hero
who's come to save this town!

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:15.250
What is it? What's happening?!

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:26.520
My investigation is not
yet complete, Erulogos.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:30.460
There's no need for it now.
Now that they've shown up.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.620
All we need to do now
is blast this area.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.330
Here they come.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.030
FLARE BIT!!!

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:45.340
GREY BOMB!

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:48.980
Go get 'em!
GOURRY BOMB!

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.010
Useless!

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:06.090
Did that surprise you?
That was the Gourry Bomb!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.300
Be still!

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:13.800
Right...

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:20.380
Still wish to fight?

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:25.180
Watch yourselves. Unlike Almayce,
these guys enjoy fighting.

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:27.410
I'll tell you this...

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:29.180
Even if we do not
destroy Darkstar...

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:33.010
...if we summon him to this world
and then close the gateway...

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:35.290
...we will have
accomplished our objective.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.260
Isn't that right, Sirius?

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.060
What did he say?!

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:39.530
Of all the selfish!

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:45.130
What happens after that
is none of our concern.

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:49.240
I see. You really are
different from Almayce.

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:51.110
You're a disgrace to the Gods!

00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:53.910
I call it being realistic.

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:02.250
Now, let me show you...

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.310
...HOW POWERLESS
YOU REALLYARE!

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:06.480
Defense barriers!

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:15.730
No! The town! The town!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.500
What power!

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:24.070
How could he?!

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:28.510
Lina! The town!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:31.450
I know! But this is taking
all the strength we have!

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:47.220
Stay back! Any closer
and I'll attack!

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.530
Mr. Hero!
Please, save our town!

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:53.540
DI FLASHER!

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:13.830
Why? Mr. Hero, why?
Why won't you say anything?

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:16.920
That's not a hero.

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.230
He's here to
destroy this world.

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:20.230
That's not true!

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:24.570
His hands are gentle,
like my father's were!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:45.420
I see. So, that's the reason.

00:16:58.340 --> 00:17:00.070
Wh- Why?

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:03.540
Mr. Hero...
I knew he'd save us!

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:09.920
And now it ends.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:11.640
Wait!

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:14.250
Sirius?!
Why are you stopping me?!

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:15.840
My investigation is complete.

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:16.820
What?!

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:19.220
I said my investigation
was COMPLETE.

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:20.850
And what does that mean?!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:21.830
Move.

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:38.570
I think he's warming
up for something big!

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:41.640
We'll never hold out against
another attack like before!

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:42.850
Miss Lina!

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:46.150
Filia, run for it!
As far as you can go!

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:46.950
Right!

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:50.320
Amelia! Zel! Another defense
barrier, and give it all you've got!

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:51.050
Right!

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:52.720
Gourry, start praying!

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:53.990
Praying?

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:56.690
I'm gonna try to counter his
attack with a Dragon Slave.

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:02.560
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows."

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.630
Damn! Outta time!

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:34.390
Another one of these.

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:36.590
It's a magic sealing crest.

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:38.190
A magic sealing crest?

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:40.030
The two are linked together.

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:43.130
I now know where the
object of our search lies.

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:46.400
At last. Good enough.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.590
There's water now!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.660
The mine must have lay
over an underground river.

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:13.260
It was his doing...
Sirius's power did this.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:15.160
Incredible...

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:17.970
I... I never expected
this would happen.

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:22.010
Okay, you ready to
face reality now, Anna?

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.380
There's no
legendary hero, right?

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:28.120
- Huh? Wait!
- Anna!

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.070
Mother's flowers are so!

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:52.800
Of course! The mine
may be gone now...

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:54.740
...but now the land
will start to recover!

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:57.820
That's right! Agriculture will
form the foundation of this land!

00:19:57.880 --> 00:19:59.880
I'm sure this town
will be rich again!

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:00.890
Right, right...

00:20:02.620 --> 00:20:05.090
Thank you, Mr. Hero...

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:13.560
Well, shall we go?

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:16.030
Hey, what happened
to Zel and Filia?

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.830
Hm? Now that
you mention it...

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:24.330
It's the same as the one we
saw in the last town, isn't it?

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:26.910
It can't be... No...

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:32.920
These stone crests were
made by the dragon race...

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:35.150
...to seal away
something terrible.

00:20:35.220 --> 00:20:38.620
After all this time,
they ended up buried underground.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:41.430
And the thing
they sealed is...

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.560
It can't be. It can't!

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:48.430
Filia? What's wrong?
Are you okay, Filia?

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:52.300
Filia! Filia!

00:22:21.460 --> 00:22:24.690
Hey! Final weapon!
Come on out, already!

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:27.200
The fate of the world's
depending on you!

00:22:27.830 --> 00:22:30.700
Next time: " Savage and Unexplored?
History Sealed Away!"

00:22:30.770 --> 00:22:33.200
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
